WEBVTT

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:16.640
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:27.660
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:33.190
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.700
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.670
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:49.410
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:54.440
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.850
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:11.170
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:23.410
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.780
"Time Table"
"Pattern A" "Pattern B"

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.810
Three... two...
one... mark.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:21.730
Judging by the building's position
and appearance...

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.140
...the layout inside is probably
something like this.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.570
I'm worried about the
immediate area.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.840
A sniper could position himself
almost anywhere.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:29.310
<i>"*4</i> floors" "Check this out"

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:29.950
We're lucky there aren't a lot of
tall buildings around here.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.440
"Phone booth" "Passage 3m"

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:31.620
"Road width 5m"

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.350
There isn't much traffic volume
early in the morning either.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:34.840
"Target"
"Underground Parking"

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:38.090
It'll all boil down to the
time of the raid.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.880
There'll be no
time to think.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:40.090
"Joto Bank"

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.690
We can't inform anybody
on the outside.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:41.830
"Joto Bank"

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:42.880
I know.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:42.890
"Joto Bank"

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.820
There mustn't be
any casualties.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.390
Right.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.590
And we can't take a hostage
with us when we escape.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:50.820
Gotcha.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.940
"Joto Bank"

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.000
"Checking and Savings"

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.740
Is there anyone who hasn't
been helped yet?

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.580
How may I help you?

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.850
Here you go...

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.580
"Give me ¥10 million."

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.090
Ma'am?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.230
"Make it fast! This is a robbery!"

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.570
Mr. Naito? Could you get
the Section Chief?

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.470
Hmm? Yes?

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.180
Don't anybody move!

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.280
Stay calm!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:45.960
We are...

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.150
We are...
...robbing this bank!

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:52.290
FILE. 21
THE BANK
ROBBERY TASK
FORCE MANUAL

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:54.250
"Joto Bank"

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.230
"ATM"

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:07.340
How could you tell that
I triggered the alarm?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:11.300
Because banks don't usually
have section chiefs.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.380
It was obviously
a code.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.230
It's the cops! The
cops are here!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.560
You'll never escape now!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.130
We'll see about that!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.360
Yeah.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.660
Let's go!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.550
"Joto Bank"

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.150
Inspector Arizuka!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:03.530
Two perpetrators have
seized the bank.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:04.900
What shall we do?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.040
I'll leave it to you,
Lt. Otomo.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.000
Sir! I will resolve the
matter at once.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.910
By the way, is this going to be part
of your inspection as well?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.550
Of course!

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.380
Of course!
Understood!

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:25.150
<i>Why must all of us at the HQ</i>
<i>have to put up with all this?</i>

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.350
<i>We're dealing with just two</i>
<i>regular policewomen!</i>

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:31.620
<i>"They've rounded up the best</i>
<i>people from headquarters."</i>

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.360
<i>"That seems pretty sufficient,</i>
<i>but what do you think?"</i>

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.160
<i>"I think that's</i>
<i>fine...</i>

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.390
<i>"...but why do we</i>
<i>have to go?"</i>

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:42.370
<i>"If they're just looking for people to</i>
<i>act as robbers, why choose us?"</i>

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.330
<i>"You two were specifically asked</i>
<i>for based on your record...</i>

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.070
<i>"...or rather, your</i>
<i>abilities."</i>

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.880
<i>"And as far as scenarios</i>
<i>are concerned...</i>

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.070
<i>"...there is no time limit</i>
<i>and anything goes."</i>

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.810
<i>"Does that mean we have complete</i>
<i>freedom to do as we like?"</i>

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:57.950
<i>"You mean to say...</i>

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:02.620
<i>"...we can do whoever, whenever,</i>
<i>wherever and whatever?!"</i>

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>"Now's my chance to try out all those</i>
<i>neat weapons I've had my eyes on!"</i>

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.900
<i>"Actually, I was thinking of</i>
<i>something less extreme."</i>

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:13.370
<i>"I don't want this to become another</i>
<i>meaningless training exercise."</i>

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.040
"lnternal Inspection Records"

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.430
<i>"If we only train using scenarios</i>
<i>where the outcome is known...</i>

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:20.370
<i>"...how can we properly react</i>
<i>to a real incident?"</i>

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.870
<i>"Well, what do</i>
<i>you think?"</i>

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.980
<i>"I'm in! I wanna do it, Inspector Arizuka!</i>
<i>This is great! I'll do it for sure!"</i>

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.080
"Please let us do it, Inspector!"

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.140
"Hey!"

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:31.380
<i>"Sir! We'll do our best!"</i>
<i>"Sir! We'll do our best!"</i>

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:34.080
<i>"Cripes!"</i>

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.800
I've got the surveillance
cameras on-line!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.270
Good.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.270
Let's hurry and wrap
this thing up.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.680
What's going on?

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.550
Hi!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.620
Today, I'll demonstrate the cleaning
action of Super Cleaner...

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:10.820
...with its magnificent
citrus cleaning oils!

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.300
Just take a look at this! A yucky
black pot with baked-on stew!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.130
Th... This is weird!

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:15.270
Just take a look at this! A yucky
black pot with baked-on stew!

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:16.400
What's going on?

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.570
Cleaning this mess is a breeze
with our new Super Cleaner.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.830
What?!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.510
Voilà! It's as shiny
as new!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.680
The first rule of a
bank robbery...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:42.850
...never let anyone outside know
what's going on inside.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.780
What does that
thing do?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.830
It replaces the surveillance camera
feed with an ordinary videotape.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.230
What?! You can't
do that!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.870
Sure we can, it's
all very simple.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.840
All you have to do is wire it
to the camera output line.

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.940
Hey, wait a minute,
this isn't fair!

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.040
Why's that?

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.510
Bank robbers don't use
equipment like that!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:06.810
No one can predict what kind
of equipment they'll use!

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.310
She's right.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.110
Look at us. We've brought along
this great big bag of tricks.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.130
All right! Our next exciting product...

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.770
I thought this might happen.
So, I brought this along.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.100
...is a sweater comb that'll wisk off
nasty little spills in no time at all.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.770
To call Officer
Uwemura?

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:29.910
...is a sweater comb that'll wisk off
nasty little spills in no time at all.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:34.500
We can't allow this
to go on forever.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.080
Help me set this
up, would you?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.220
No problem.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.490
Otomo here.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.260
Got it!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.400
Hello. This is Uwemura.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.760
Hello? Hello?

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.130
Hi! Thanks for calling!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.000
This is Mika!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.340
What's this thing
anyway?

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:09.340
It jams cell phone
frequencies.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.510
Hello? Hello?

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:16.240
Cell phones have been used to inform the
outside world of robbery attempts.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:26.280
Hi! Thanks for calling!
This is Mika!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.730
All the frequencies
are jammed!

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.670
They're pretty systematic
about this.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.930
We're going to have to
get tough on them.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:37.770
Huh?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.010
Get me the SWAT Team!
Are you there?

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.740
SWAT Team! Do you read me?
Hi! Thanks for calling! This is Mika!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.780
Roger. SWAT Team.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.180
We're in position.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.320
All right! We're counting
on you!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.290
Yes, sir.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.320
They'd never guess that we'd
be shooting from up here.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.060
"Video & CD Rental"

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:08.930
Going just as planned!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.940
What'd be the point of this exercise if they
could catch us right away?! Right?

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:15.640
Yep. I'm gonna put some sensors on
the windows. Stay and keep watch.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:16.610
Leave it to me.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.880
Gotcha.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.480
Let's give them a taste
of our Olympic skills.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.830
Yes, sir!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.960
Ready...

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.270
Fire!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.000
What's this?!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.270
What's wrong?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.170
Aha! Got 'em all!

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.340
How?!

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.610
How did they
find us?!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.710
How on earth did they
know we were here?!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.550
Stop bothering us!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.780
Withdraw!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.650
That's the only position the
SWAT Team could take.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.760
I bet you can't
wait to see...

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.170
...what I have in store
for you next!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.510
I'm very sorry,
sir!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.550
W... Well...

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:34.350
Let's just say it was
only a run-through.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.120
Sir?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.590
This was just a run-through, so you could
get a feel for the surroundings.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:39.820
Isn't that right?!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.560
This incident is supposed
to be an exercise, right?

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.930
It doesn't matter what you call
it, it was just a run-through!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.200
Yes, sir!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.200
This is a run-through
for the exercise.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:51.840
Good.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.810
And from this point on,
it's the real thing!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.330
Okay! We're back from the break...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.430
I'm sorry! I'll be able to fix this soon.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:13.760
...and have some very exciting products

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:14.830
How long do you mean by "soon?"

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.630
I just know you're going to love it!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:21.060
SWAT Team, here. Trying to reposition...
Hi! Thanks for calling! This is Mika!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.960
"Reposition," huh?

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.940
There's nowhere they can take up position?

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.010
Damn...

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.380
Did you say something?

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.350
No, sir!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.710
<i>It's been 2 hours and 54 minutes</i>
<i>since this started.</i>

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:38.690
<i>And it doesn't look like it's going to be</i>
<i>over soon. What's going on here?</i>

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.220
<i>These stupid bumbling</i>
<i>idiots!</i>

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.160
What do they think
they're doing?!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.910
Hey! This is a training
exercise!

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.910
Act serious!

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.380
Bank robbers...

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.350
Huh?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.870
What else are we supposed to do?

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.140
Um...

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.920
I guess we'd better take the money.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.890
Huh?

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.960
Let's bust open
the safe!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.220
Hey! That's not part
of the exercise!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.890
A special key is required
to open the safe...

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.270
...outside of specified time periods!

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.240
...outside of specified time periods!
Is that so?

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.610
No wonder they
call it a safe.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:41.950
Remember, we're supposed
to use our heads!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.920
I'm begging you! Please
don't do this!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.890
Anyway, there's no
way you'll open it.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.420
Wanna bet?

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:53.990
Four hours and thirty-
nine minutes.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:58.590
We can't allow them to get away with
this freak show any longer!

00:13:58.740 --> 00:13:59.430
"Freak show?"

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.070
It's come to this. We're just going
to have to storm the place.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:07.410
Lieutenant Tanaka! Riot Squad!
I'm counting on you!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:11.010
Yes, sir!

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:26.090
Is there any chance
she'll get it open?

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.320
No, it's impossible!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.620
They've come.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:53.350
Natsumi? Can you get me
7 rolls of toilet paper?

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.490
Okay!

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:59.000
Toilet paper?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.100
What does she need that for?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:00.890
Who knows?!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.280
I've just come to get
some toilet paper!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.040
You're one of
the robbers!

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:18.610
Get her!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:19.480
Do it, men!

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:24.620
What's going on?!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.290
It's coming from the bathroom! They've
come to save us!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.720
It's open!

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.520
Huh?!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.260
Sorry.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.840
I didn't get your
toilet paper.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:43.740
Seems it's all gotten
a little damaged!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.800
Instead of the toilet paper, let's
grab some bills from the safe!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.280
Oh, yeah! Let's!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.190
Could they get any more
childish than this?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.230
Not bad, huh?!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.500
Your turn.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.470
Leave it to me!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.350
Oh, yeah! And now for the cash...

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:25.410
And the escape... but...

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.450
I guess we shouldn't really take
the money, should we?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.590
Guess not. Then...

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.850
How about those?

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.290
"Joto Bank"

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.130
Come in, Riot
Squad!

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:41.590
Come in!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.670
Can you read me, Riot Squad?!
Come in, Tanaka!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.640
Come in!

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.070
The shutter's opening!

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:47.870
What?!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.430
It's terrible!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.410
The robbers have
gotten away!

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.210
Storm the bank!

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:57.010
Storm the bank!
Yes, sir!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.380
What the devil?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.180
The hostages are
all fine, sir.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.580
However, the robbers are
nowhere to be found!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.280
The lid's off the manhole in the
underground parking lot, sir!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.550
What?!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.370
There they go!

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.500
Get those thieves!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.970
Run!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.410
Hurry!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:34.070
Don't let them get away!
Find those robbers!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:42.720
There they are! I've found
them! This way!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.190
This way!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.030
In here!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.140
That was slick!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.780
Don't let your guard
down just yet.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.350
What the?!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.160
You'll pay
for this!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:36.640
And so, the bank robbers
made their getaway!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.580
But the uniforms
and car are real.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.520
Well, we couldn't
find fake ones.

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:44.650
Precisely.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.220
Calling all units!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:50.350
Be on the lookout for
a bogus patrol car...

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:53.520
...and seize it when
you find it!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.650
Don't let it get away!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:57.130
Find that car!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.800
Oh, no. Are they
onto us already?

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.130
Oh boy.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.340
Here they come.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.350
D'oh!

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.250
What on earth are you
stopping for?!

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:16.320
Huh?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.260
Why on earth did you stop?!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.850
Why on earth did you stop?!
Well sir, it's kind of obvious.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.320
Do you think robbers
stop for red lights?

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.620
This is just an exercise.
I had no choice.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.730
This is an emergency!

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:32.130
But isn't this an
exercise, sir?

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.700
It's an emergency
exercise!

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:38.670
Hey! Here they come!

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:42.010
That just means we'll have
to turn on the nitro!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.870
Stop!

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:46.610
Don't let them
get away!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.810
Stop! I'm ordering
you to pull over!

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:51.580
Don't let them
get away!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.880
All right, Natsumi! Back
to the station.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.020
Okay!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:01.820
They've passed the
Bokuto Bridge...

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.660
...and gone through
the roadblock.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:05.670
We're in hot
pursuit.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:08.760
We're passing the intersection
in district three.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:12.240
Request back-up!
PLEASE!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:20.810
Five...

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.470
Four... Three...

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:23.420
Two...

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.250
One...

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:26.320
Zero!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.690
Made it!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:39.400
You did it!
Way to go!

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:45.970
We've accomplished
our mission.

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:51.870
Way to go!

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:00.650
Uh-oh.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.420
Oh, no.

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.890
What do you think you're
trying to pull?

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:09.150
What kind of exercise
do you think this is?!

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:11.600
Are you proud of
yourselves?

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:13.140
All right. That's enough.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:16.430
All right. That's enough.
Huh? Oh! Inspector Arizuka!

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:19.470
This exercise is officially
completed.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:20.530
Yes, sir!

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.750
But, sir! But, these... What about these two?!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:27.680
I'm pleased with the outcome of today's drill.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.310
We will continue this
type of exercise...

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:38.790
...in an effort to respond to the
many varieties of crime.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.070
Good job, officers!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.030
Yeah!

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:52.870
I can't take it
anymore!

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:08.920
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:21.100
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:32.110
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:40.220
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:48.950
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:57.870
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:05.440
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:15.160
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.260
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:26.260
"Once in a Lifetime"

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.230
What?! Yoriko found
herself a man?!

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:32.310
And I heard he's younger
than her.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.140
Well, that's not
the way I'd go.

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:35.680
That's not the
issue!

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:39.250
Nakajima, she might get
hitched before you do!

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:41.250
That's not the
issue!

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:44.510
Hey you guys, what are
you talking about?

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:47.460
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 22...

00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:47.690
FILE. 22
YORIKO NIKAIDOU'S
DAY OFF

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:49.460
..."Yoriko Nikaidou's Day Off."

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:51.590
A younger man, huh?
